  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IKEA Global Responsible Raw Materials Framework Agreement</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Under this Framework Agreement, Pact will support IKEA in their work to ensure responsible sourcing of materials in their supply chains. Pact anticipates that the cobalt supply chain will be a primary area of focus, but there may be others identified over the course of this consultancy agreement. Specific scopes of work will be determined and delivered via Service Orders issued under this Framework Agreement.</narrative>
